+What:           /sys/bus/platform/drivers/vdec/.../recovering
+Date:           October 2026
+Contact:        linux-media@vger.kernel.org
+Description:
+                Read-only recovery state for the Amlogic T7 encoder. 1 means
+                new opens and hardware jobs are blocked while all old queues
+                are failed and the driver attempts a drained power cycle of
